{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal fails to ensure the transport impacts of the development are adequately addressed, for; 1) provision and allocation of car parking, 2) the provision of safe residential access, 2) provision and access of cycle storage, 3) provision of designated residential waste and recycling storage. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the terms of Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA, Paragraph MA.2 (2)(a) of the Town and County Planning (General Permitted Development)(England) Order (2015)(as amended)."
